# ════════════════════════════════════════════
# PixelPaw - Auth Tests (Sa-Token)
# 按顺序执行；第 3 步拿到 token 后粘到第 4/5/6 步
# ════════════════════════════════════════════

# 1. 不带 token 访问受保护接口 → 期望 HTTP 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets?page=1&size=10

###

# 2. 注册 admin（只跑一次；重复跑提示"手机号已注册"）
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000000",
  "password": "admin123",
  "username": "admin"
}

###

# 3. 登录 → 从响应 data 里复制 token
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "phone": "13800000000",
  "password": "admin123"
}

###

# 4. 带 token 访问 → 期望 HTTP 200
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets?page=1&size=10
Authorization: <粘贴第3步的 token>

###

# 5. 登出 → 期望 HTTP 200
POST http://localhost:8080/api/auth/logout
Authorization: <同一个 token>

###

# 6. 登出后带原 token 再访问 → 期望 HTTP 401
GET http://localhost:8080/api/pets?page=1&size=10
Authorization: <同一个 token>